  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults",
    "actors",
    "Ysondkhelir",
    "items",
    "C91ggah5Ye65LrMH",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "<p>Many denizens of Leng carry strange rubies mined from quarries in Leng. As long as a creature holds a Leng ruby that it willingly accepted as a gift or payment from a denizen of Leng, any denizen of Leng can target that creature with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KSAEhNfZyXMO7Z7V]{Outcast's Curse}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.R8bqnYiThB6MYTxD]{Phantom Pain}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KHnhPHL4x1AQHfbC]{Mind Reading} at a range of 1 mile, and the bearer uses an outcome one degree of success worse than the result of its saving throw against <em>Outcast's Curse</em>.</p>",
   "current": null
  },
