  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults",
    "actors",
    "Zebub",
    "items",
    "Translocate (At Will)",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "<p>You instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container—the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are then temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults",
    "actors",
    "Zebub",
    "items",
    "Invisibility (at will, self only)",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults",
    "actors",
    "Zebub",
    "items",
    "Summon Animal (swarm creatures only)",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "<p>You summon a creature that has the animal trait and whose level is –1 to fight for you.</p><hr><p><strong>Heightened</strong> As listed in the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.journals.JournalEntry.S55aqwWIzpQRFhcq.JournalEntryPage.8gcp880pEWZ9VPnF]{summon} trait.</p>",
   "current": null
  },
  {
   "path": [
    "entries",
    "Abomination Vaults",
    "actors",
    "Zebub",
    "items",
    "Diabolic Eye",
    "description"
   ],
   "style": "prose",
   "field": "description",
   "en": "<p>The zebub records everything they see, and though they don't remember all observations, they can pass them along to another creature.</p>\n<p>The zebub replays 10 minutes of witnessed events to a touched willing creature, which receives the memories in a flash of information. By remaining in contact, the zebub can spend additional 3-action activities to replay more information.</p>\n<p>After relaying their visions to another, the zebub can't ever recall those events again.</p>",
   "current": null
  },
